        "n-728eca": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Sidewalk",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-d8167f": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Sunrise streaks the New York Street sidewalk at the north edge of Esri's campus in Redlands, California.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-48c0d0": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "New York Street",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-3e0d49": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The headquarters building, completed in 2010, unifies the campus. New York Street used to bisect the campus, but a portion of the street was closed, and the building straddles the old right of way.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-926af4": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Palms",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-3f35a2": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Stately palm trees line New York Street and frame views of the headquarters building.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-045aaa": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Wild iris",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-e3126b": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "An iris blooms in an artificial pond by the entrance to headquarters, called Building Q.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-58fe11": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "View from the atrium",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-a90d79": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A four-story glass atrium affords views of New York Street and Redlands. A second-floor lounge faces north.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-e5118a": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Auditorium",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-960d1c": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "An intimate auditorium is used for company and Redlands community events.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-4b868b": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Atrium view",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-55c094": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Looking south through the glass atrium wall.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-193058": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Staircase",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-3a450c": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A dramatic cantilevered staircase dominates the Building Q Atrium.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-58e67c": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Geography",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-0b2a0f": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Near a back entrance to Esri's Cafe is this ivy-framed paean to the discipline that underlies Esri's products.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-d826f6": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Landscaping for people",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-1ec983": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Esri's campus has numerous outdoor seating areas to encourage impromptu al fresco meetings.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-902fba": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Geranium and Building L",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-738cb9": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A bright flowering plant accents the entrance to Building L on the east side of the campus.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-004bcb": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Inside the Cafe",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-f74915": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The Cafe is a light-filled gathering place for coffee, lunch, and special events.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-6781ab": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Glass and rock",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-f917ab": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Boulders provide a contrast to the clean lines of the Cafe. Landscape architect and Esri founder Jack Dangermond personally supervised their placement.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-a3d5a5": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Flowering palm",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-0203af": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "An ornamental palm near the entrance to building M",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-bf1312": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Building M hallway",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-1b0379": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A typical Esri office area features wide hallways and small glassed-in offices, encouraging interaction among staff.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-8b4192": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Courtyard pond",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-adad51": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The peaceful courtyard between Buildings M and MA includes this artifical wetland.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-ada4a6": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Sunning turtles",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-84ee48": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The pond is home to several sun-seeking red-eared turtles.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-91cbdd": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Architecture as backdrop",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-c4053d": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Most of Esri's buildings are dark and unobtrusive, emphasizing the naturalistic landscape.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-4fb974": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Working out",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-3146d2": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "An ivy-colored gym at the campus's west end provides exercise equipment.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-bd7256": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Living with nature",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-0bf89b": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Building OA's dark walls set off a tree and a hummingbird feeder.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-6560f9": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Artwork",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-7d0a80": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A mobile stands near the entrance to Building O.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-dec6ea": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Building Q",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-985286": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "The headquarters building is a dramatic exception to the subdued architecture of most of the campus. It was designed by the Danish firm HVIDT ARKITEKTER.",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-c4ea6e": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "h3",
                "text": "Headquarters entrance",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
        "n-1e4daa": {
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A return to the main entrance of Building Q brings our campus tour to a close. We hope you can visit in person soon!",
                "textAlignment": "start"
            }
        },
